== curve
ok   the four known points lie on C
ok   [0:1:0] is not on C
ok   P0 = [0:0:1] is a smooth point, tangent 2x + 5y = 0
ok   Res_y(F,Hess)(x,1) has degree 24 (no flex on z = 0)
ok   Res_y(F,Hess)(x,1) irreducible (24 distinct simple flexes, distinct x)
ok   P0 is not a flex
== flexes and triangles over K24 = Q[w]/(flex)
ok   gcd(F(x0,y), Hess(x0,y)) is linear in y
ok   tangent at p meets C again at a point q != p
ok   q is a flex (flex(xq) = 0 in K24)
ok   y(q) = Ypol(x(q)) (q is the flex with that x)
ok   tangent at q meets C again at r = g(q)
ok   tangent at r meets C again at p (triangle closes)
ok   p, q, r pairwise distinct
ok   p, q, r not collinear
== the triangle algebra
ok   x(p)+x(q)+x(r) has degree 8
ok   its field is isomorphic to A3 = Q[a]/(a^8+2a^7+7a^4-14a^2-8a+5)
ok   A3 has no nontrivial automorphism (unique embedding)
ok   th8 is a root of A3pol in K24
ok   1, th8, ..., th8^7 independent over Q
== the cubic G through the triangle
ok   y(x) solves F(x,y(x),1) = O(x^7)
ok   the 9 conditions have a 1-dimensional solution space over K24
ok   the coefficient of y z^2 is nonzero
ok   no z^3 term (P0 on G)
ok   linear part at P0 proportional to 2x + 5y
GA = Mod(-182126/5246875*a^7 + 116484/5246875*a^6 + 189401/5246875*a^5 - 863261/5246875*a^4 + 21839/5246875*a^3 + 2573121/5246875*a^2 + 961083/5246875*a - 454616/1049375, a^8 + 2*a^7 + 7*a^4 - 14*a^2 - 8*a + 5)*x^3 + (Mod(-122607/5246875*a^7 - 902587/5246875*a^6 - 827093/5246875*a^5 + 444073/5246875*a^4 - 1067727/5246875*a^3 - 2132803/5246875*a^2 + 4020006/5246875*a + 1206963/1049375, a^8 + 2*a^7 + 7*a^4 - 14*a^2 - 8*a + 5)*y + Mod(59838/1049375*a^7 + 129658/1049375*a^6 - 89788/1049375*a^5 + 77468/1049375*a^4 + 379668/1049375*a^3 - 338648/1049375*a^2 - 880554/1049375*a + 127933/209875, a^8 + 2*a^7 + 7*a^4 - 14*a^2 - 8*a + 5)*z)*x^2 + (Mod(17193/1049375*a^7 + 263088/1049375*a^6 - 44268/1049375*a^5 - 252002/1049375*a^4 + 609698/1049375*a^3 + 599272/1049375*a^2 - 1013769/1049375*a + 24338/209875, a^8 + 2*a^7 + 7*a^4 - 14*a^2 - 8*a + 5)*y^2 + Mod(31933/209875*a^7 + 81553/209875*a^6 - 12758/209875*a^5 + 32138/209875*a^4 + 191838/209875*a^3 - 113268/209875*a^2 - 513939/209875*a - 54837/41975, a^8 + 2*a^7 + 7*a^4 - 14*a^2 - 8*a + 5)*z*y + Mod(2/5, a^8 + 2*a^7 + 7*a^4 - 14*a^2 - 8*a + 5)*z^2)*x + (Mod(9682/209875*a^7 + 1844/9125*a^6 - 55232/209875*a^5 - 19748/209875*a^4 + 6524/9125*a^3 - 20272/209875*a^2 - 9222/9125*a - 9428/41975, a^8 + 2*a^7 + 7*a^4 - 14*a^2 - 8*a + 5)*y^3 + Mod(1007/41975*a^7 + 8362/41975*a^6 + 16068/41975*a^5 - 3298/41975*a^4 + 1002/41975*a^3 + 28028/41975*a^2 - 36831/41975*a - 15328/8395, a^8 + 2*a^7 + 7*a^4 - 14*a^2 - 8*a + 5)*z*y^2 + Mod(1, a^8 + 2*a^7 + 7*a^4 - 14*a^2 - 8*a + 5)*z^2*y)
ok   cT divides the flex polynomial over A3
== the divisor of G_A
ok   Res_y(F, G_A)(x,1) has degree 12 (no point of C.G on z = 0)
ok   exponent of x is exactly 3
ok   cT^2 divides
ok   cT^3 does not divide
ok   residual has degree 3
ok   residual cubic has rational coefficients
r3 = 1633*x^3 - 4901*x^2 + 3500*x + 6250
ok   r3 = 1633x^3 - 4901x^2 + 3500x + 6250 up to sign
ok   r3 irreducible over Q
ok   r3 prime to x and to the flex polynomial
ok   gcd(F(u,y), g_0(u,y), ..., g_7(u,y)) is linear over Q(u): R is Q-rational, common to all conjugates
R: x = u, y = 1633/3115*u^2 - 5617/6230*u + 375/1246, r3(u) = 0
ok   the three points of R are not collinear (yR has degree 2 in u)
== the cubic Psi with div = 6 P0 + 2 R
ok   the 12 conditions (order >= 6 at P0, contact >= 2 at R) have a 1-dimensional solution over Q
Psi = -161*x^3 + (110*y + 52*z)*x^2 + (-225*y^2 - 327*z*y + 92*z^2)*x + (-522*y^3 + 65*z*y^2 + 230*z^2*y)
ok   Res_y(F, Psi)(x,1) has degree 12
ok   Res_y(F, Psi) = const x^6 r3^2 (div Psi = 6P0 + 2R = 2E)
== norm identity N_{A3/Q}(G_A) = c Hess^2 Psi^4 mod F (sampled on C(F_p), p split in A3; evidence only)
